  "body": "Premium Build in a Coastal Hotspot\r\nThis quality house and land package offers a lifestyle you’ll love in sought-after Stanmore Bay.\r\nKey Features\r\n•\t4 Bedrooms\r\n•\t2 Bathrooms (including ensuite)\r\n•\t1 Spacious Open-Plan Living Area\r\n•\tDesigner Kitchen with Scullery & Bosch Appliances\r\n•\tDouble Garage + 2 Off-Street Parks\r\n•\tLand Area: 475m²\r\n•\tFloor Area: 160m²\r\n•\tTimber Deck (20m²)\r\n\r\nA well-designed, single-level home featuring:\r\n• 4 well-proportioned bedrooms including master with ensuite\r\n• Open plan kitchen, dining & lounge – perfect for entertaining\r\n•Designer kitchen with scullery and premium Bosch stainless steel appliances\r\n• Modern bathrooms with wall-hung vanities, quality tapware and tiles\r\n• Double glazed joinery and upgraded insulation for comfort and efficiency\r\n• 10-Year Stamford Building Warranty for peace of mind\r\n\r\nEnjoy beachside living in one of Whangaparaoa’s most desirable suburbs.\r\nThis home is just minutes from:\r\n•\tStanmore Bay Beach & Leisure Centre\r\n•\tCoast Plaza Shopping Centre\r\n•\tCafés, restaurants, and local schools\r\n•\tShakespear Regional Park & walking trails\r\n•\tLocal boat ramps and marine activities\r\n\r\nLive the relaxed coastal lifestyle with all the conveniences of city living nearby.\r\n\r\n ?? Contact us today to secure this beautiful home, customised to suit your lifestyle!\r\n\r\nThis package can be tailored to suit your budget & personal requirements. \r\nThese pictures are an indication of what your dream home could look like.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, Contact Sanketh on 027 7733336 or email sanketh@navigationhomes.co.nz \r\n\r\nOr check out or website http://www.navigationhomes.co.nz We look forward to hearing from you!",
